{"id":"a-jin059-volume-yao-father","subject_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAC","object_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAA","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"琅邪王伷子繇"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yue","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-prince-yue-ws2650517","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yue:p001","quote":"東海孝獻王越，字元超，高密王泰之次子也。少有令名，謙虛持布衣之操，為中外所宗。初以世子為騎都尉，與駙馬都尉楊邈及琅邪王伷子繇俱侍講東宮，拜散騎侍郎，曆左衛將軍，加侍中。討楊駿有功，封五千戶侯。遷散騎常侍、輔國將軍、尚書右僕射，領遊擊將軍。復為侍中，加奉車都尉，給溫信五十人，別封東海王，食六縣。永康初，為中書令，徙侍中，遷司空，領中書監。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yue:p001:m0061","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yue:p001:m0059"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"繇與越、楊邈同侍講。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAC","title":"東安王","surname":"司馬","ming":"繇","additional_names":[],"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-038","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-038-langye-near-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family:line028","quote":"伷既戚屬尊重，加有平吳之功，克己恭儉，無矜滿之色，僚吏盡力，百姓懷化。疾篤，賜床帳、衣服、錢帛、秔梁等物，遣侍中問焉。太康四年薨，時年五十七。臨終表求葬母太妃陵次，並乞分國封四子，帝許之。子恭王覲立。又封次子澹為武陵王，繇為東安王，漼為淮陵王。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"note":"姓名與原稱分開記錄；司馬姓據已核帝室父系暫分，女性姓據原稱，不補本名。傳中含諡號的敘事稱號不等同生前授號，未記任期不補。"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family:line028:m0110","start":110,"end":111,"surface":"繇","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAC","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family:line028","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:line156:m0010","start":10,"end":14,"surface":"東安王繇","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAC","status":"context